  "body": "## Summary\n- count Today / This week / Previous full week from Vinted `published_at`, not observer `first_seen_at`\n- resolve publication time during the initial baseline as well as for legacy rows still missing it\n- clear synthetic `published_at = first_seen_at` values created by the local compatibility fallback so they can be backfilled correctly\n- expose backend IDs still missing publication time, so Playwright only revisits rows that actually need enrichment\n- count confirmed FIRST_OFFER negotiations even when messageStatus remained UNKNOWN, instead of incorrectly showing 0\n- keep normal bot/session/login/worker behavior untouched\n\n## Expected behavior\nAt e.g. 16:00, `Today` counts listings actually published since 00:00; `This week` includes Monday + Tuesday + today according to the real Vinted publication timestamp. Baseline listings are included when their Vinted timestamp falls into the window.\n",
